imbridge sticker tapbacks: send-sticker-tapback {chatGuid, filePath, stickerId, stickerHash, selectedMessageGuid,
partIndex?} tapbacks a message part with a sticker (associated type 2007): the image goes up as a transfer marked as a
sticker, with the sticker info Messages' tapback menu gives its stickers, and IMTapbackSender sends it as an
IMStickerTapback on the part's chat item, the way Messages' own tapbacks go out. Also factors the lookup of a message's
part chat item (IMBMessagePart) out of send-sticker.

